# Trace query — real Donghu short runnable dependency
#
# Coverage target: a narrow trace-only window should identify the immediate
# runnable/scheduler dependency on the wakeup path without importing broader
# later-frame IO episodes as the dominant cause.
ID="trace_query_donghu_real_short_runnable"
NAME="trace query — real Donghu short runnable dependency"
QUESTION="只分析这份 trace，不分析代码。请分析 com.baidu.tieba 59566 主线程在 34579.472865s 到 34579.475857s 的短窗口卡顿原因。请判断主要等待来自哪条依赖/唤醒关系、链上线程状态和调度资源背景。"
HTRACE_FILE="../../customlogs/xxx_all.systrace"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="CookieMonsterCl com.baidu.tieba"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(runnable|可运行|调度|scheduler|CPU|runqueue).*(CookieMonsterCl|优先级反转|priority inversion)|(CookieMonsterCl|优先级反转|priority inversion).*(runnable|可运行|调度|scheduler|CPU|runqueue)
(低优先级|优先级反转|priority inversion|lower priority|prio)
(唤醒|依赖|wakeup|chain)"
EXPECT_MATCHES_TEXT_REGEX="CookieMonsterCl.*com\\.baidu\\.tieba|com\\.baidu\\.tieba.*CookieMonsterCl"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="still_present not_enough_evidence"
EXPECT_LOG_MATCHES_REGEX="phase=toolcall .*tool=trace_query"
